{"obsah":"<p>The very idea of riding around the whole Czech Republic by bike is exhausting for me, and respect to everyone who voluntarily signs up for this event as a rider. Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Mára Tryner and Matouš Balík from our club were riders too – but luckily only with a Trial show, which they put on at the start in the morning.</p>\n\n<p>In half an hour they showed both classic Trial and overcoming obstacles on regular mountain bikes. Hopefully it whetted the participants' appetite a bit and they decided that rather than risk the obstacles, they'll do those 1,400 kilometres.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks for the invitation – hopefully everyone gets through those few days safely. From the exhibition the guys went straight to the Trutnov trails, where they flew down the black routes – Ptačí perspektiva deserves special praise. It has some really well-made rocky sections, though you could figure out a few harder lines there :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5918.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"174922\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5918-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=174922\" class=\"wp-image-174922\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5833.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"174923\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5833-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=174923\" class=\"wp-image-174923\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5826.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"174924\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5826-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=174924\" class=\"wp-image-174924\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5805.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"174925\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5805-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=174925\" class=\"wp-image-174925\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5949-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"174921\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2Fdsc_5949-1-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=174921\" class=\"wp-image-174921\"/></figure></li></ul></figure>\n\n<p></p>"}